alida directa al jardín, que conecta con la piscina comunitaria.\n\nEn la primera planta se encuentra la espaciosa suite principal, con vestidor tipo pasarela, baño en suite con luz natural y una terraza privada con vistas relajantes al jardín. El dormitorio de invitados es igualmente amplio y luminoso, ofreciendo la misma sensación de calma y bienestar. Cada rincón de la casa está pensado para disfrutar del día a día o de largas estancias con total confort.\n\nUbicada en una urbanización segura y exclusiva a los pies de la Sierra Blanca, Casa Serenity combina privacidad con ‌un ‌estilo ‌andaluz ‌atemporal. ‌Los ‌residentes disfrutan ‌de jardines ‌cuidados, una piscina de diseño ‌arquitectónico ‌y ‌un ‌entorno ‌de tranquilidad, a pocos ‌minutos ‌de ‌las ‌mejores ‌comodidades ‌de ‌Marbella.","en":"Casa Serenity is a bright and elegant townhouse designed for comfort and privacy. It features an open living and dining area filled with natural light, a fully equipped modern kitchen with quality appliances, and seamless access to a peaceful garden. The home includes a versatile office with a full bathroom and direct garden access leading to a communal pool.\n\nThe first floor offers a spacious master suite with a walk-through wardrobe, skylit ensuite, and private terrace with serene garden views. A generous guest suite provides the same sense of light and tranquility. Every space feels calm, refined, and perfectly planned for daily living or long stays.\n\nLocated in a secure and exclusive neighbourhood beneath the Sierra Blanca mountains, Casa ‌Serenity ‌combines ‌privacy ‌with ‌timeless ‌Andalusian style. ‌Residents enjoy ‌landscaped grounds and an architect-designed ‌pool ‌in ‌an ‌area ‌known for its peaceful ‌charm ‌and ‌proximity ‌to ‌Marbella’s ‌best ‌amenities."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Este","Excelente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","